  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR 11 or higher. &laquo;Flare Arrow&raquo; and &laquo;Orb of Lava&raquo; ignore &nbsp;[Cancel: Flame] status on targets.</p>\n<p>(SR2): &laquo;Burned Stake&raquo; [Hate] cost is reduced by -1 (minimum 0).</p>\n<hr>\n<p>You are a sorcerer who specializes in the magic of manipulating flames. You can freely use flames of destruction that are difficult to control.</p>",
